<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Splunk APM on Splunk Observability Cloud Workshops</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/financial-services-observability-cloud/4-apm/</link><description>Recent content in Splunk APM on Splunk Observability Cloud Workshops</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>pt-BR</language><atom:link href="https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/financial-services-observability-cloud/4-apm/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>1. APM Explore</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/financial-services-observability-cloud/4-apm/1-apm-explore/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/financial-services-observability-cloud/4-apm/1-apm-explore/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Ao acessar a seção APM do Splunk Observability Cloud, você verá uma visão geral dos dados do APM, incluindo os principais serviços por taxa de erros e as métricas R.E.D. de serviços e workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O Service Map do APM exibe as dependências e conexões entre seus serviços instrumentados e inferidos no APM. O mapa é gerado dinamicamente com base nas suas seleções nos filtros de intervalo de tempo, ambiente, fluxo de trabalho, serviço e tag.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2. APM Service View</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/financial-services-observability-cloud/4-apm/2-apm-service-view/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/financial-services-observability-cloud/4-apm/2-apm-service-view/</guid><description>&lt;div class="callout callout--info"&gt;&lt;span class="callout__icon" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/&gt;&lt;line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"/&gt;&lt;line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p class="callout__title"&gt;Visualização de serviço&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="callout__body"&gt;Como proprietários de serviço, você pode usar a visualização de serviço no Splunk APM para obter uma visão completa da integridade do seu serviço em um único painel. A visualização de serviço inclui um indicador de nível de serviço (SLI) para métricas de disponibilidade, dependências, solicitação, erro e duração (RED), métricas de tempo de execução, métricas de infraestrutura, Tag Spotlight, endpoints e logs para um serviço selecionado. Você também pode navegar rapidamente até a criação de perfil de código e de memória para seu serviço na visualização de serviço.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure class="figure"&gt;
 &lt;div class="figure__inner"&gt;
 &lt;img src="../images/apm-service-dashboard.png" alt="Painel de serviço" loading="lazy" decoding="async"&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>3. APM Tag Spotlight</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/financial-services-observability-cloud/4-apm/3-apm-tag-spotlight/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/financial-services-observability-cloud/4-apm/3-apm-tag-spotlight/</guid><description>&lt;div class="callout callout--success"&gt;&lt;span class="callout__icon" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p class="callout__title"&gt;Exercício&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="callout__body"&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Para ver as tags do &lt;strong&gt;wire-transfer-service&lt;/strong&gt;, clique em &lt;strong&gt;wire-transfer-service&lt;/strong&gt; e depois em &lt;strong&gt;Tag Spotlight&lt;/strong&gt; no painel de funções à direita (dependendo da resolução da tela, talvez seja necessário rolar para baixo). Quando estiver no &lt;strong&gt;Tag Spotlight&lt;/strong&gt;, verifique se a opção &lt;strong&gt;Show tags with no values&lt;/strong&gt; está desativada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure class="figure"&gt;
 &lt;div class="figure__inner"&gt;
 &lt;img src="../images/apm-tag-spotlight.png" alt="Destaque da etiqueta APM" loading="lazy" decoding="async"&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As visualizações em &lt;strong&gt;Tag Spotlight&lt;/strong&gt; são configuráveis ​​tanto para o gráfico quanto para os cartões. A visualização é padronizada como &lt;strong&gt;Requests &amp;amp; Errors&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>4. APM Service Breakdown</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/financial-services-observability-cloud/4-apm/4-apm-service-breakdown/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/financial-services-observability-cloud/4-apm/4-apm-service-breakdown/</guid><description>&lt;div class="callout callout--success"&gt;&lt;span class="callout__icon" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p class="callout__title"&gt;Exercício&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="callout__body"&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Selecione o &lt;strong&gt;wire-transfer-service&lt;/strong&gt; no Service Map.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No painel direito, clique em &lt;button class="btn-inline btn-inline--filled" type="button" style="--btn-color: var(--color-ink-muted)"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Breakdown&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Selecione &lt;code&gt;tenant.level&lt;/code&gt; na lista.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De volta ao Service Map, clique em &lt;strong&gt;gold&lt;/strong&gt; (nosso nível de usuário mais valioso).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clique em &lt;button class="btn-inline btn-inline--filled" type="button" style="--btn-color: var(--color-ink-muted)"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Breakdown&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt; e selecione &lt;code&gt;version&lt;/code&gt;, esta é a tag que expõe a versão do serviço.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Repita isso para &lt;strong&gt;prata&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;bronze&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class="tabs" data-tabs&gt;
&lt;div class="tabs__list" role="tablist"&gt;&lt;button id="tabs---home-runner-work-observability-workshop-observability-workshop-content-pt-br-splunk4rookies-financial-services-observability-cloud-4-apm-4-apm-service-breakdown-md-1-1--2-tab-0" class="tabs__btn is-active" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="tabs---home-runner-work-observability-workshop-observability-workshop-content-pt-br-splunk4rookies-financial-services-observability-cloud-4-apm-4-apm-service-breakdown-md-1-1--2-panel-0" tabindex="0" data-tab-label="Pergunta"&gt;Pergunta&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="tabs---home-runner-work-observability-workshop-observability-workshop-content-pt-br-splunk4rookies-financial-services-observability-cloud-4-apm-4-apm-service-breakdown-md-1-1--2-tab-1" class="tabs__btn" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="tabs---home-runner-work-observability-workshop-observability-workshop-content-pt-br-splunk4rookies-financial-services-observability-cloud-4-apm-4-apm-service-breakdown-md-1-1--2-panel-1" tabindex="-1" data-tab-label="Resposta"&gt;Resposta&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id="tabs---home-runner-work-observability-workshop-observability-workshop-content-pt-br-splunk4rookies-financial-services-observability-cloud-4-apm-4-apm-service-breakdown-md-1-1--2-panel-0" class="tabs__panel is-active" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tabs---home-runner-work-observability-workshop-observability-workshop-content-pt-br-splunk4rookies-financial-services-observability-cloud-4-apm-4-apm-service-breakdown-md-1-1--2-tab-0" data-tab-label="Pergunta"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;O que você pode concluir do que está vendo?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id="tabs---home-runner-work-observability-workshop-observability-workshop-content-pt-br-splunk4rookies-financial-services-observability-cloud-4-apm-4-apm-service-breakdown-md-1-1--2-panel-1" class="tabs__panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tabs---home-runner-work-observability-workshop-observability-workshop-content-pt-br-splunk4rookies-financial-services-observability-cloud-4-apm-4-apm-service-breakdown-md-1-1--2-tab-1" hidden data-tab-label="Resposta"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cada &lt;code&gt;tenant.level&lt;/code&gt; está sendo impactado por &lt;code&gt;v350.10&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agora você verá o &lt;strong&gt;wire-transfer-service&lt;/strong&gt; dividido em três serviços: &lt;strong&gt;gold&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;silver&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;bronze&lt;/strong&gt;. Cada tenant é dividido em dois serviços, um para cada versão (&lt;code&gt;v350.10&lt;/code&gt; e &lt;code&gt;v350.9&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>5. APM Trace Analyzer</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/financial-services-observability-cloud/4-apm/5-apm-trace-analyzer/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/financial-services-observability-cloud/4-apm/5-apm-trace-analyzer/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Como o Splunk APM oferece visibilidade &lt;strong&gt;NoSample&lt;/strong&gt; de ponta a ponta de todos os serviços, ele captura cada trace. Neste workshop, o &lt;strong&gt;orderId&lt;/strong&gt; da transferência bancária está disponível como uma tag. Isso significa que podemos usá-lo para localizar o trace exato da experiência insatisfatória encontrada pelos usuários.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="callout callout--info"&gt;&lt;span class="callout__icon" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/&gt;&lt;line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"/&gt;&lt;line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p class="callout__title"&gt;Analisador de rastreamento&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="callout__body"&gt;Splunk Observability Cloud fornece diversas ferramentas para explorar dados de monitoramento de aplicativos. &lt;strong&gt;Trace Analyzer&lt;/strong&gt; é adequado para cenários em que você tem pesquisas e explorações de alta cardinalidade e alta granularidade para pesquisar problemas novos ou desconhecidos.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="callout callout--success"&gt;&lt;span class="callout__icon" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p class="callout__title"&gt;Exercício&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>6. APM Waterfall</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/financial-services-observability-cloud/4-apm/6-apm-waterfall/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/financial-services-observability-cloud/4-apm/6-apm-waterfall/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Chegamos ao &lt;strong&gt;Trace Waterfall&lt;/strong&gt; do &lt;strong&gt;Trace Analyzer&lt;/strong&gt;. Um trace é uma coleção de intervalos que compartilham o mesmo ID de rastreamento, representando uma transação exclusiva tratada pelo seu aplicativo e seus serviços constituintes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cada intervalo no Splunk APM captura uma única operação. O Splunk APM considera um intervalo como um intervalo de erro se a operação que o intervalo captura resultar em um erro.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure class="figure"&gt;
 &lt;div class="figure__inner"&gt;
 &lt;img src="../images/apm-trace-waterfall.png" alt="Traçar cascata" loading="lazy" decoding="async"&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="callout callout--success"&gt;&lt;span class="callout__icon" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p class="callout__title"&gt;Exercício&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>